  "body_html": "<p>Transform any bedroom into a vibrant haven for softball enthusiasts with this sporty comforter set. Designed for comfort and durability, this set is perfect for softball players and fans alike, offering a cozy and stylish way to show team spirit.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Celebrate your passion for softball with a dynamic design, perfect for any player or fan.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an eco-friendly finishing process that locks in color, preventing fading and ensuring long-lasting vibrancy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and breathable feel, more durable than cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and quick-drying; for best results, tumble dry low and consider using a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one comforter, offering a complete bedding solution.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal for napping, reading, or travel, adding comfort and style wherever you go.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
